---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Todo from '../components/Todo.astro';
---
<Base title="Ponies" description="The Manipuri ponies of Chingkhei Hunba Polo Club.">
  <PageHeader title="Ponies" lede="Polo in Manipur is played on the Manipuri pony. These are the club’s." />

  <p>
    A club that fields several sides needs a string of ponies for each. In Manipuri polo, players commonly keep
    their own ponies, and much of the work happens away from the tournament ground: feeding, grazing, shoeing
    and schooling.
  </p>
  <Todo>Named ponies with photos and short stories (owner’s consent), how the ponies are kept and grazed, and any the club is proud of.</Todo>

  <div class="grid">
    {[1, 2, 3].map(() => (
      <div class="card">
        <div class="placeholder-img">Pony photo</div>
        <h3>Pony name</h3>
        <p class="muted">Kept by · Age · A line about the pony</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2>Looking after the Manipuri pony</h2>
  <p>
    Many organisations work on conserving the Manipuri pony. The club’s part is the everyday one: keeping ponies,
    riding them, and bringing new riders to them.
  </p>
</Base>
